<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Cookie · LChat</title><main><h1>Cookie and local storage</h1><p>LChat uses cookie session to save login. Without them, authorization does not work.</p><p>Interface settings and a mark indicating acceptance of this notification are saved in the browser’s local storage. The mark is stored until the site data is deleted in the browser.</p><h2>How to delete data</h2><p>You can delete cookie and data chat.lbs.su in the browser settings. After deletion, you will need to log in to your account again and configure the interface. Lock cookie may prevent entry.</p><p>Questions: <a href="mailto:admin@example.com">admin@example.com</a>.</p><p><a href="privacy.php">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="index.php">In messenger</a></p></main></html>